# Test Standards

- File name: `<feature>.spec.ts` under `tests/ui` or `tests/api`.
- Tag suites: `@smoke`, `@ui`, `@api`, `@regression`.
- Arrange → Act → Assert; one primary behavior per test.
- Pull users with fixtures (`standardUser`, `lockedUser`) or `getUser('key')`.
- On failure, rely on configured screenshot/trace/video — do not add manual debug noise.
- Data-driven Excel cases: read via `ExcelUtil.readSheet`, do not paste large tables into specs.
